	(text_box "DDR4 pins\n\n-- DATA group --\nData Mask 9 pins: MDM0-8\nData 64 pins: MDQ00 - MDQ63\nData Strobe 9 diffs: MDQS0/MDQS0_B MDQS8/MDQS8_B\nECC 8 pins: MECC0-MECC7\n\n-- Address/Command Group --\nAddress 14 pins:			MA0 - MA13\nBAnk 2 pins:				BA0 BA1\nBank Group 2pins:		BG0 BG1\nRAS/CAS/WE 3 pins:		MRAS_B, MCAS_B, MWE_B\nActivate:				MACT_B\n\n-- Control Group --\nCS 4 pins:				MCS0_B MCS1_B MCS2_B MCS3_B \nClock enable 2 pins:		MCKE0 MCKE1\nODT 2 pins:				MODT0 MODT1\nAddress Parity:			MPAR\nAlert:					MALERT_B\n\n-- CLK group\nClock 2 diffs:			MCK0/MCK0_B MCK1/MCK1_B\n\n-- OTHER --\nImpedance Calib 2 pins:	MDIC0 MDIC1\n\nNO DDR RESET pin. The HALDG doc asks to use HRESET instead\n\n======================================\nOPTIONS\n1 Rank will only use CLK0, CS0, CKE0, ODT0\n2 Rank will also use CLK1, CS1, CKE1, ODT1\nCS2 CS3 not used on uDIMMS (socket datasheet)\n======================================\nROUTING\n\nOrder: Data, AC, Control, Clocks, Power\nAlternate adjacent datalanes on different layers\n\nTrace Length Match:\nKeep data/AC longest lead-in shorter than 7 inch\nData lanes matched to 2 inches\nData lane to Data strobe: 20mil\nData lane space between serpentine loop: 25mil\n\n\nSwap:\nByte swap allowed\nBit swap only within a nibble\nNibble swap allowed in the same byte lane\n\n======================================\n\nOne DDR4 chip has:\n\nAddress: 14\nBank: 2\nBank Group: 2\nCS/RAS/CAS/WE\nActivate: 1\n\nClock Enable: 1\nODT: 1\n\nClock: 1 pair\n\nData: 8\nData Strobe: 1 pair\nData Mask: 1\nData Inversion: 1\n\nReset\nParity\nVREFCA\nZQ\n\n\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
